      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effects of fibrates on lipoprotein profiles and lipoprotein physiology, as well as on selected coagulation and fibrinolytic factors are reviewed. It is concluded that the action of fibrates on these systems is such as to render the fibrates beneficial in atherosclerosis prevention."},
